就绪 · 把左侧组件拖到画布上开始设计=Ready · drag a component from the left onto the canvas
在画布中选中一个组件，即可在此编辑属性=Select a widget on the canvas to edit its properties here
拖到画布中放置，或双击直接添加=Drag onto canvas, or double-click to add
导入 .japa=Import .japa
重新检测=Re-detect
语言包是 UTF-8 文本，扩展名 .japa，一行一条「原文 → 译文」：=Language packs are UTF-8 text with the .japa extension, one "original -> translation" per line:
文件名随便取，认的是 .japa 后缀。=The file name can be anything; only the .japa extension matters.
程序目录、用户目录、当前项目目录以及它们下面的 Language 文件夹，=Packs placed in the program folder, the user folder, the current project folder
里面放的语言包都会自动列在上面的下拉框里。=and their Language sub-folders are listed in the dropdown above automatically.
译文会替换内置界面文字，没写到的保持原样。=Translations replace the built-in UI text; anything not translated stays as is.
已检测到 %d 个可用 Java（已用 java -version 验证）=%d usable Java (verified with java -version)
还没检测到可用的 Java，点「重新检测」再试一次=No usable Java detected - try "Detect again" once more
自动（跟随当前运行环境）=Automatic (follow the current runtime)
不指定，直接用启动创作器的那个 Java=If not set, the Java that launched the creator is used
简体中文（内置）=Simplified Chinese (built-in)
